# DJ01: the added waves running in the booted OS, with the audio clock (run with --ssi0-hz --ips 150e6, so the frame
# handler runs 1,500 times a second and calls evaluator A through dv_frame_hook). MOD page, LFO 1 of track 1: FUNC +
# turn E (WAVE to its default, 1, SINE), then E up 6 (DV-F, 7); then 3 s of emulated time. The end snapshot shows dv_frame (frames counted), track 1's loop and every voice row's LFO 1 state.
wait-emu 0.5
tap semicolon        # MOD: LFO 1
wait-emu 0.5
down space
wait-emu 0.1
tap 5
wait-emu 0.2
up space
wait-emu 0.4
png 00-wave-default
tap 5
wait-emu 0.25
tap 5
wait-emu 0.25
tap 5
wait-emu 0.25
tap 5
wait-emu 0.25
tap 5
wait-emu 0.25
tap 5
wait-emu 0.4
png 01-dvf
wait-emu 3.0
png 02-after-3s
